                <object label="Download is optional. Viewing does not accept the invoice.&#xa;Saved-file access does not wait for original recovery or ERP receipt." link="../../specs/invoice-receiving/SPEC-SEI-026-invoice-retrieval-logical-feature-specification.md#customer-list-open-and-download" id="customer-rule">
