                <object label="Why retrieve a faithful copy?" link="../../specs/invoice-receiving/SPEC-SEI-025-invoice-retrieval-solution-summary.md#why-retrieve-faithful-copy" id="why-copy-title">
                    <mxCell parent="1" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;spacing=2;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=23;fontColor=#222222;" vertex="1">
                        <mxGeometry height="36" width="786" x="62" y="2152" as="geometry"/>
                    </mxCell>
                </object>
                <object label="The copy is part of normal private exchange, not only a retrieval fallback.&#xa;Allow safe, authorised view/download while original recovery is pending.&#xa;Preserve public evidence for later matching; keep original recovery open." link="../../specs/invoice-receiving/SPEC-SEI-025-invoice-retrieval-solution-summary.md#why-retrieve-faithful-copy" id="why-copy-body">
                    <mxCell parent="1" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;spacing=2;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=17;fontColor=#222222;" vertex="1">
                        <mxGeometry height="122" width="786" x="62" y="2194" as="geometry"/>
                    </mxCell>
                </object>
                <object label="One invoice; separate results" link="../../specs/invoice-receiving/SPEC-SEI-026-invoice-retrieval-logical-feature-specification.md#copy-only-engineering-behaviour" id="status-note-title">
                    <mxCell parent="1" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;spacing=2;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=23;fontColor=#222222;" vertex="1">
                        <mxGeometry height="36" width="796" x="942" y="2152" as="geometry"/>
                    </mxCell>
                </object>
                <object label="“Paid” can coexist with “Original retrieval pending.”&#xa;The copy has no second business lifecycle. Assess reports separately.&#xa;Copy-only approval, rejection, posting and payment need decisions.&#xa;ERP intake waits for the original under product policy." link="../../specs/invoice-receiving/SPEC-SEI-026-invoice-retrieval-logical-feature-specification.md#copy-only-engineering-behaviour" id="status-note-body">
                    <mxCell parent="1" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;spacing=2;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=17;fontColor=#222222;" vertex="1">
                        <mxGeometry height="122" width="796" x="942" y="2194" as="geometry"/>
                    </mxCell>
                </object>
                <object label="Proposed workflow · Colours group activities, not implementation readiness. Detailed controls: SPEC026 and SPEC029." link="../../specs/invoice-receiving/SPEC-SEI-025-invoice-retrieval-solution-summary.md#6-material-decisions-and-dependencies" id="footer">
